s7-p3 : Block
s7-p3 = prose (cons "A processor is one specified evolving system: its architectural state, permitted transitions, observations, and interaction with devices are part of its description, and circuitry realizes that description under a stated physical correspondence. The same form of reasoning used for other processes applies to its executions. A program may contain the machine's interpreter or its representation, and the program constructing the machine's executable realization can itself be interpreted and transformed." nil)
